msgstr "Føjet til favoritter"

msgid ""
"Adding entries works with .ashy copies. For a .db copy, choose “Replace”."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjelse af poster virker med .ashy-kopier. For en .db-kopi skal du vælge "
"“Erstat”."

msgid "Address copied"
msgstr "Adresse kopieret"

msgid "Address, user and password are required"
msgstr "Adresse, bruger og adgangskode er påkrævet"

msgid "Adjust length and characters"
msgstr "Justér længde og tegn"

msgid "Adjust number of digits"
msgstr "Justér antal cifre"

msgid "Adjust words and separator"
msgstr "Justér ord og skilletegn"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanceret"

msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritme"

msgid "All"
msgstr "Alle"

msgid "All clear"
msgstr "Alt i orden"

msgid "All entries are synchronized with Nextcloud Passwords."
msgstr "Alle poster synkroniseres med Nextcloud Passwords."

msgid "All fields are required."
msgstr "Alle felter skal udfyldes."

msgid "All folders"
msgstr "Alle mapper"

msgid ""
"All partitions, files, and filesystem signatures will be permanently "
"destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Alle partitioner, filer og filsystemsignaturer vil blive permanent ødelagt."

msgid "Allow Ashy Pass in Dropbox"
msgstr "Tillad Ashy Pass i Dropbox"

msgid "Allow TRIM through encrypted mapping"
msgstr "Tillad TRIM gennem krypteret kortlægning"

msgid "Allow the browser extension"
msgstr "Tillad browserudvidelsen"

msgid ""
"Another device deleted them from the encrypted sync folder. If that was you, "
"they move to Deleted items here. If not, keep them: they are sent to the "
"folder again."
msgstr ""
"En anden enhed har slettet dem fra den krypterede synkroniseringsmappe. Hvis "
"det var dig, flyttes de til Slettede elementer her. Hvis ikke, så behold "
"dem: de sendes til mappen igen."

msgid ""
"Another device uploaded a newer snapshot since this device last synced. "
"Uploading now would orphan the remote changes."
msgstr ""
"En anden enhed har uploadet et nyere snapshot, siden denne enhed sidst "
"synkroniserede. Upload nu vil gøre fjernændringerne forældreløse."

msgid "Another example"
msgstr "Et andet eksempel"

msgid "Anyone who gets the file can read every password in it"
msgstr "Alle, der får fat i filen, kan læse hver eneste adgangskode i den"

msgid ""
"Anyone who gets the file can see what it contains: names, users, websites, "
"passwords and notes. Verification codes, folders and attachments are not "
"included. Confirm your master password to continue."
msgstr ""
"Alle, der får fat i filen, kan se, hvad den indeholder: navne, brugere, "
"websteder, adgangskoder og noter. Bekræftelseskoder, mapper og vedhæftninger "
"er ikke med. Bekræft din hovedadgangskode for at fortsætte."

msgid "App password"
msgstr "App-adgangskode"

msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Udseende"

msgid "Application"
msgstr "Applikation"

msgid "Applying local deletions"
msgstr "Anvender lokale sletninger"

msgid "Ashy Pass backups"
msgstr "Sikkerhedskopier fra Ashy Pass"

msgid ""
"Ashy Pass cannot recover the master password, and there is no PIN on this "
"computer. If you have a backup and remember its passwords, you can restore "
"it in Backups after creating a new vault."
msgstr ""
"Ashy Pass kan ikke gendanne hovedadgangskoden, og der er ingen PIN-kode på "
"denne computer. Har du en sikkerhedskopi og husker dens adgangskoder, kan du "
"gendanne den under Sikkerhedskopier efter at have oprettet en ny boks."

msgid ""
"Ashy Pass cannot recover this password. Without it, nobody — including you — "
"can open the vault. Write it down somewhere safe."
msgstr ""
"Ashy Pass kan ikke gendanne denne adgangskode. Uden den kan ingen — heller "
"ikke dig — åbne boksen. Skriv den ned et sikkert sted."

msgid ""
"Ashy Pass could not reach Nextcloud. Check your connection, server address, "
"and app password."
msgstr ""
"Ashy Pass kunne ikke kommunikere med Nextcloud. Kontroller din forbindelse, "
"serveradressen og app-adgangskoden."

msgid "Ashy Pass for Chrome"
msgstr "Ashy Pass til Chrome"

msgid "Ashy Pass for Firefox"
msgstr "Ashy Pass til Firefox"

msgid ""
"Ashy Pass will close. Open it again to continue; your vault file was not "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Ashy Pass lukkes. Åbn det igen for at fortsætte; boksfilen er ikke slettet."

msgid ""
"Asks history managers such as Big Clipboard and Klipper not to record them"
msgstr ""
"Beder historikprogrammer som Big Clipboard og Klipper om ikke at gemme dem"

msgid ""
"At least 8 characters. A four-word passphrase from the EFF wordlist is a "
"strong default."
msgstr ""
"Mindst 8 tegn. En adgangssætning på fire ord fra EFF-ordlisten er et stærkt "
"standardvalg."

#, rust-format
msgid ""
"At least {} characters. A few random words are easy to remember and hard to "
"guess."
msgstr ""
"Mindst {} tegn. Nogle få tilfældige ord er nemme at huske og svære at gætte."

